# Documentation Audit Command

When the user says **"run documentation audit"**, **"documentation audit"**, or **"run doc audit"**:

## What to do

1. Launch one subagent (generalPurpose) and instruct it to follow `docs/process/documentation-audit-process.md`.
2. Require output report at `docs/audits/documentation/YYYY-MM-DD-documentation-audit.md`.
3. Audit only. Do not make code changes.
4. After completion, summarize top findings and report location.

## References

- Process: `docs/process/documentation-audit-process.md`
- Reports: `docs/audits/documentation/`
